# REFLECT — gates

**Артефакт:** `memory-bank/back/reflection/reflection-[task_id].md`

## Gates

1. Implementation завершена (QA pass или scope done)
2. reflection: successes, problems, lessons, improvements
3. Compare vs plan/decompose
4. `tasks.md` append-only

## Level delta

| L | Depth |
|---|--------|
| L2 | краткая, key lessons |
| L3 | + process / component notes |
| L4 | + architectural / cross-cutting |

## Abort

- Не завершено → QA / IMPLEMENT first
